{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>處境劇《愛·回家之三代同糖》一眾演員為宣傳再度發放爆笑彈！車婉婉、樊亦敏、沈可欣、羅毓儀聯同甄敏芳及穎喬，日前齊齊破格換上超萌「女僕裝」驚喜現身活動，推介最新劇情發展，吸睛造型瞬間成為全場焦點！</p><p><p><img alt=\"06f4fcd2-b423-46d8-a829-cb419b51efd7.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026yt51Noe9DJ1793607177.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>一眾女星為了劇集宣傳可謂去到盡，不但悉心打扮，更極度入戲大玩女僕Cosplay。她們在台上即場向粉絲「施展魔法」進行甜蜜互動，各種嬌俏Pose與搞笑對白交織，將《三代同糖》的歡樂與愛意完美傳遞開去，場面既搞笑又溫馨，成功融化在場所有觀眾。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-02 at 4.08.46 PM.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pMuYDZlHl41793607175.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"7499387e-3d9d-4a06-b314-1169b601e5f2.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20260oafCeHCYL1793607179.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>此外，是次活動更驚喜大搞Crossover，特別邀請到人氣實境節目《女神配對計劃2》的「求愛勇者」丁標，聯同演員侯雋熙及李茵彤化身活動主持。丁標面對著台上陣容強大的「女僕團」，雙方互動產生出意想不到的爆笑火花，為活動掀起另一波高潮。</p><p><p><img alt=\"13083f2a-a093-40cc-a5ee-b2c2820dcebb.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026CCr11oxTzl1793607178.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"7491c40e-c1bf-43fe-a6df-96a81e19a3d5.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026RqWIlhdX4K1793607177.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:23:42.524340+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:38:55.414433+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:19:51.624610+00:00","content_hash":"65cc525dcfed262b8cc1d25475a055f5904dbce1017ce4051c9a331a1466eb64","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:23:42.524340+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}